{"id":402602021,"chapter_id":50070,"scene_id":57007,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"你的身体不知道变成了什么，还陷进异世界的终端，要想把这样状态的你送到所谓“刺杀神明”的现场绝非易事。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":2,"content":"但这位技术专家显然做到了。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":3,"content":"只是简单的几项指令，你就感受到一阵奇妙的波动，随即身体轻盈了起来。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":4,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"现在你已经成功数据化了，我可以把你转移到她上一次长时间停留的地点。刚好那里就有一个符合要求的终端。","voice":["vo_event_402602021_04"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26202","style":11,"background":10115,"log_type":1},{"step":5,"options":["……"],"jump":[6],"style":6,"background":10115,"log_type":1},{"step":6,"content":"你还在脑海里设想所谓的需求，摩尔就已经把它实现了。","style":3,"background":10115,"log_type":1},{"step":7,"speaker":"瑞思","content":"到现场要小心，我们不知道“神”是什么东西，更不知道那个禁闭者说的“杀死神”是怎样。","voice":["vo_event_402602021_06"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26202","style":11,"background":10115,"log_type":1},{"step":8,"speaker":"选项","options":["嗯，我会小心的"],"jump":[9],"style":6,"background":10115,"log_type":1},{"step":9,"content":"【穿越抵达】","style":18,"background":10115,"log_type":1},{"step":10,"content":"在数据通道中穿行的速度和摩尔做需求的速度一样快，但等到了终点，你才发现或许是自己的时间感知出了问题。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":11,"content":"“你”被随手放在一个昏暗的房间里，外面已经入夜了，而正对着的则是一块写满了异世界文字的巨大白板。","style":3,"background":2254,"log_type":1},{"step":12,"content":"还没等你看清上面的文字，视野却被什么东西遮挡住了。你下意识地伸出手，却很快意识到这是徒劳。","style":3,"background":2255,"log_type":1},{"step":13,"content":"滴答——","style":3,"background":2256,"log_type":1},{"step":14,"content":"是血迹，刺杀已经完成了。","style":3,"background":2256,"log_type":1},{"step":15,"content":"你听到瑞思倒吸一口凉气。","style":3,"background":2256,"log_type":1},{"step":16,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"现场应该很可怕吧，真是糟糕。","voice":["vo_event_402602021_28"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26202","style":11,"background":2256,"log_type":1},{"step":17,"speaker":"选项","options":["瑞思，麻烦连线治安官调查"],"jump":[18],"style":6,"background":2256,"log_type":1},{"step":18,"speaker":"瑞思","content":"……我马上回来。","voice":["vo_event_402602021_15"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26202","style":11,"background":2256,"log_type":1},{"step":19,"content":"实习生的脚步远离了。","style":3,"background":2256,"log_type":1},{"step":20,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"你是特地支开她的吗，好温柔的局长。","voice":["vo_event_402602021_16"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26202","style":11,"background":2256,"log_type":1},{"step":21,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"毕竟只是年轻的实习生。再怎么靠谱，看到杀人现场也会害怕吧。","style":2,"background":2256,"log_type":1},{"step":22,"speaker":"选项","options":["你不要紧吗？感觉难受吗？"],"jump":[23],"style":6,"background":2256,"log_type":1},{"step":23,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"嗯？我该有什么感觉？","voice":["vo_event_402602021_19"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26202","style":11,"background":2256,"log_type":1},{"step":24,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"嘿嘿没事的，我还没睡醒呢，不怕。尽情调查，局长，我会对现场采集的数据进行统一解码分析。","voice":["vo_event_402602021_20"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26202","style":11,"background":2256,"log_type":1},{"step":25,"content":"你眼前出现一道光圈，似乎是某种解码的过程，在摩尔的指示下，你试图用手去触碰。","style":3,"background":2256,"log_type":1},{"step":26,"content":"调查1","style":28,"background":2256,"log_type":1},{"step":27,"content":"摩尔将她们还原的画面返回，加入翻译并去除了血迹，现在你能看得更清晰一些。","style":3,"background":2256,"log_type":1},{"step":28,"content":"调查2","style":26,"background":2254,"log_type":1},{"step":29,"content":"左侧的内容看起来像是一些普通的美术设计上的工作流程，只是有些内容不能够很好地翻译过来。","style":3,"background":2254,"log_type":1},{"step":30,"content":"里面似乎还夹杂着一些给自己鼓劲打气的话语。","style":3,"background":2254,"log_type":1},{"step":31,"content":"调查3","style":26,"background":2254,"log_type":1},{"step":32,"content":"右侧的内容主要是一些乐曲的分类，倒是好理解一些。右下侧似乎有一副手绘的涂鸦，看上去非常潦草。","style":3,"background":2254,"log_type":1},{"step":33,"content":"调查4","style":26,"background":2254,"log_type":1},{"step":34,"content":"你好奇地放大看去，画面上的内容有些让人费解，那似乎是某种鸟类动物的死亡场景，和其他的内容格格不入。","style":3,"background":2258,"log_type":1},{"step":35,"content":"看起来只是寻常人的工作。","style":3,"background":2256,"log_type":1},{"step":36,"content":"一点也不像000说的主宰世界的神。","style":3,"background":2256,"log_type":1},{"step":37,"content":"【调查结束】","style":18,"background":2256,"log_type":1},{"step":38,"content":"有声音突然响起，是条传送到这部终端上的信息，而你能看到它。","style":3,"background":2256,"log_type":1},{"step":39,"content":"“大概几点回来，要给你留门吗？”","style":14,"background":2256,"log_type":1},{"step":40,"content":"你感到一种窒息感。","style":3,"background":2256,"log_type":1},{"step":41,"content":"这里太普通、太寻常，就像新城某家小公司里的一间会议室。","style":3,"background":2256,"log_type":1},{"step":42,"content":"以至于让人感到，死在这里的不是什么“神”，而是跟那些你在街头遇到的路人一样，一些普通人罢了。","style":3,"background":2256,"log_type":1},{"step":43,"speaker":"选项","options":["你在吧？出来"],"jump":[44],"style":6,"background":2256,"log_type":1},{"step":44,"content":"她没有出现，却只让你听到声音。","style":3,"background":2256,"log_type":1},{"step":45,"speaker":"000","content":"嘿嘿，我就在想你什么时候能发现我。","voice":["vo_event_402602021_49"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26202","style":1,"background":2256,"log_type":1},{"step":46,"speaker":"000","content":"怎么一脸不高兴的表情，气我偷看你查案？","voice":["vo_event_402602021_134"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26202","style":1,"background":2256,"log_type":1},{"step":47,"speaker":"000","content":"还是气我在这儿犯了案？","voice":["vo_event_402602021_135"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26202","style":1,"background":2256,"log_type":1},{"step":48,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"我习惯对危险分子保持警惕，尤其是你这样手段凶狠的人。","style":2,"background":2256,"log_type":1},{"step":49,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"你在这儿杀了人吧？","style":2,"background":2256,"log_type":1},{"step":50,"speaker":"000","content":"它们不是“人”哦，局长。跟你不在同个世界，不是同类，对你没有同情。","voice":["vo_event_402602021_50"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26202","style":1,"background":2256,"log_type":1},{"step":51,"speaker":"000","content":"它们从不在乎你在乎的事，你又为什么要介意它们的死活呢？难道平时你也在杀掉死役后为它们掉眼泪吗？","voice":["vo_event_402602021_51"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26202","style":1,"background":2256,"log_type":1},{"step":52,"speaker":"选项","options":["你认为我还会信你说的话吗"],"jump":[53],"style":6,"background":2256,"log_type":1},{"step":53,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"在不断的绑架、欺骗、利用我之后？","style":2,"background":2256,"log_type":1},{"step":54,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"不要以为把我限制在这种地方就能妨碍我看到真相，我并不是一个人。","style":2,"background":2256,"log_type":1},{"step":55,"speaker":"选项","options":["摩尔小姐！"],"jump":[56],"style":6,"background":2256,"log_type":1},{"step":56,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"没问题，现场监控镜头已骇入，数据联通，局长，监控画面已经实时传到你那边。","voice":["vo_event_402602021_53"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26202","style":11,"background":2256,"log_type":1},{"step":57,"content":"【转入雪花屏】","style":18,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":58,"speaker":"000","content":"等等！","voice":["vo_event_402602021_54"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26202","style":1,"background":2263,"log_type":1},{"step":59,"content":"监控镜头并不听从000的指令，而是投向了另一侧的地面。","style":3,"background":2263,"log_type":1},{"step":60,"content":"【鸭子死亡现场】","style":18,"background":2263,"log_type":1},{"step":61,"speaker":"000","content":"唉……起码让我打扫一下现场啊。场面这么血腥，你一定又要讨厌我了。","voice":["vo_event_402602021_56"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26202","style":1,"background":2259,"log_type":1},{"step":62,"speaker":"选项","options":["……这是什么"],"jump":[63],"style":6,"background":2259,"log_type":1},{"step":63,"speaker":"000","content":"神啊？准确地说，是被我杀害的神的尸体。抱歉哦我是手段凶残的坏女人。","voice":["vo_event_402602021_57"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26202","style":1,"background":2259,"log_type":1},{"step":64,"speaker":"选项","options":["……你耍我呢？"],"jump":[65],"style":6,"background":2259,"log_type":1},{"step":65,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"这不是只鸭子吗？还是长得这么滑稽的鸭子。","style":2,"background":2259,"log_type":1},{"step":66,"speaker":"000","content":"你在质疑我的智商？过分，不要拿你那低维生物的想象力擅自揣测神的真容。","voice":["vo_event_402602021_60"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26202","style":1,"background":2259,"log_type":1},{"step":67,"speaker":"000","content":"人家就长这样怎么了？多可爱，不能以貌取神。","voice":["vo_event_402602021_61"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26202","style":1,"background":2259,"log_type":1},{"step":68,"speaker":"选项","options":["它都漏棉花了！"],"jump":[69],"style":6,"background":2259,"log_type":1},{"step":69,"speaker":"000","content":"挑剔！这就是创造你们游戏的神，不信你看！","voice":["vo_event_402602021_62"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26202