太仓促了，留下部分异常残留。","voice":["vo_event_402602021_22"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26202","style":11,"background":2259,"log_type":1},{"step":89,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"我怀疑在这个谋杀现场有更深度的事实遭到篡改，但还没确认其中的具体机制。","voice":["vo_event_402602021_23"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26202","style":11,"background":2259,"log_type":1},{"step":90,"content":"你看到000饶有趣味地挑了挑眉。","style":3,"background":2259,"log_type":1},{"step":91,"speaker":"选项","options":["果然是个骗局"],"jump":[92],"style":6,"background":2259,"log_type":1},{"step":92,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"另外，我从局长目前入侵的死者手机中检索并解码得到大量影像声音资料，部分数据上了锁无法访问，但从开放内容看来，的确跟狄斯城的状况吻合。","voice":["vo_event_402602021_24"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26202","style":11,"background":2259,"log_type":1},{"step":93,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"值得注意的是，部分内容最近遭到异常修改，而这些修改内容能完全对应城邦最近的异象。","voice":["vo_event_402602021_25"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26202","style":11,"background":2259,"log_type":1},{"step":94,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"也就是说，不管是鸭子还是神，在这个现场确实有某种存在，它拥有足以篡改我们世界的强大力量，这种影响力或许超过我们的想象。","voice":["vo_event_402602021_26"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26202","style":11,"background":2259,"log_type":1},{"step":95,"content":"……","style":3,"background":2259,"log_type":1},{"step":96,"speaker":"选项","options":["谢谢你，我明白了"],"jump":[97],"style":6,"background":2259,"log_type":1},{"step":97,"speaker":"000","content":"……我说呢，怪不得刚刚能从我的手里抢人，原来来了个专家，一下子就能抓住重点。","voice":["vo_event_402602021_83"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26202","style":1,"background":2259,"log_type":1},{"step":98,"speaker":"000","content":"摩尔，对吧？","voice":["vo_event_402602021_85"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26202","style":1,"background":2259,"log_type":1},{"step":99,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"谢谢夸奖。帮助局长是我的工作。","voice":["vo_event_402602021_86"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26202","style":11,"background":2259,"log_type":1},{"step":100,"speaker":"000","content":"是吗……那麻烦你帮帮他，我们的局长看起来还搞不清情况。","female_content":"是吗……那麻烦你帮帮她，我们的局长看起来还搞不清情况。","voice":["vo_event_402602021_89","vo_event_402602021_89f"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26202","style":1,"background":2259,"log_type":1},{"step":101,"content":"说着，她重新转向你。","style":3,"background":2259,"log_type":1},{"step":102,"speaker":"000","content":"神长什么样根本不重要，我把它们变成这样也只是让你放轻松些，别那么严肃。","voice":["vo_event_402602021_90"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26202","style":1,"background":2259,"log_type":1},{"step":103,"speaker":"000","content":"如果看到真正的死亡现场，你一定会很生气的。","voice":["vo_event_402602021_111"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26202","style":1,"background":2259,"log_type":1},{"step":104,"speaker":"选项","options":["……真正的现场是什么样子？"],"jump":[105],"style":6,"background":2259,"log_type":1},{"step":105,"content":"你脑中闪过各种令人不安的画面，那两只玩偶背后到底是什么……","style":3,"background":2259,"log_type":1},{"step":106,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"在这里被杀的到底是什么，这些鸭子到底是——","style":2,"background":2259,"log_type":1},{"step":107,"speaker":"000","content":"你以为是什么呢？神？鸭子？还是跟你一样的<color=#fb9259>人</color>？","voice":["vo_event_402602021_112"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26202","style":1,"background":2259,"log_type":1},{"step":108,"speaker":"000","content":"呵呵这都不重要了。不管它们曾经是什么，现在都被变成这副模样，被变成了别的存在。","voice":["vo_event_402602021_113"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26202","style":1,"background":2259,"log_type":1},{"step":109,"speaker":"000","content":"——因为我杀了两个神，夺走支配外形和声音的权力，我已经代替了它们。","voice":["vo_event_402602021_114"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26202","style":1,"background":2259,"log_type":1},{"step":110,"speaker":"000","content":"这还只是头两个，等我得到全部……","voice":["vo_event_402602021_115"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26202","style":1,"background":2259,"log_type":1},{"step":111,"speaker":"选项","options":["我不会让你这么做的。"],"jump":[112],"style":6,"background":2259,"log_type":1},{"step":112,"speaker":"000","content":"那你来我这边呀？来当我的同伴，跟我一起完成这条弑神夺权的道路，到时候这力量就是你的。","voice":["vo_event_402602021_116"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26202","style":1,"background":2259,"log_type":1},{"step":113,"speaker":"000","content":"你不放心我玩弄世界，那就由你来，我真心实意邀请你。","voice":["vo_event_402602021_117"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26202","style":1,"background":2259,"log_type":1},{"step":114,"speaker":"选项","options":["我拒绝"],"jump":[115],"style":6,"background":2259,"log_type":1},{"step":115,"speaker":"000","content":"为什么？你明明是个灵活的人，也乐意尝试新可能。为什么就不考虑我呢？","voice":["vo_event_402602021_118"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26202","style":1,"background":2259,"log_type":1},{"step":116,"speaker":"000","content":"换个立场看看嘛，这才是一劳永逸解决所有难题实现所有愿望的方法。","voice":["vo_event_402602021_119"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26202","style":1,"background":2259,"log_type":1},{"step":117,"speaker":"选项","options":["绝不"],"jump":[118],"style":6,"background":2259,"log_type":1},{"step":118,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"你们这样低级的诱惑已经来过很多次了，我不会上当的。","style":2,"background":2259,"log_type":1},{"step":119,"speaker":"000","content":"真的要拒绝吗？哪怕只有一点点，你没心动过吗？对我的提案没有过好奇吗？不想试试第二个选择吗？","voice":["vo_event_402602021_120"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26202","style":1,"background":2259,"log_type":1},{"step":120,"speaker":"选项","options":["没有第二个选择"],"jump":[121],"style":6,"background":2259,"log_type":1},{"step":121,"speaker":"000","content":"……无论如何都不肯跟我站在一起吗？","voice":["vo_event_402602021_121"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26202","style":1,"background":2259,"log_type":1},{"step":122,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"别再问了，我只会拼尽全力阻止你。","style":2,"background":2259,"log_type":1},{"step":123,"speaker":"000","content":"哈哈哈哈我当然知道，逗你玩的！","voice":["vo_event_402602021_122"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26202","style":1,"background":2259,"log_type":1},{"step":124,"speaker":"000","content":"你绝对不会选择我，不会被我诱惑。你是局长，决不动摇，决不违抗自己的本心。","voice":["vo_event_402602021_123"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26202","style":1,"background":2259,"log_type":1},{"step":125,"speaker":"000","content":"可那真的是你的本心吗？还是别人设计给你的呢？","voice":["vo_event_402602021_124"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26202","style":1,"background":2259,"log_type":1},{"step":126,"content":"……","style":3,"background":2259,"log_type":1},{"step":127,"content":"…………","style":3,"background":2259,"log_type":1},{"step":128,"speaker":"选项","options":["别跟我来这套"],"jump":[129],"style":6,"background":2259,"log_type":1},{"step":129,"content":"她笑了。","style":3,"background":2259,"log_type":1},{"step":130,"speaker":"000","content":"我不勉强，我知道现在的你根本没有别的选择，你只能走它们给你的道路。那也没关系。","voice":["vo_event_402602021_125"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26202","style":1,"background":2259,"log_type":1},{"step":131,"speaker":"000","content":"就当一场游戏吧，死去的只是呆呆玩具鸭，来这边只为无厘头的快乐冒险，你唯一的敌人是个肤浅又白日做梦的奇怪禁闭者。","voice":["vo_event_402602021_126"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26202","style":1,"background":2259,"log_type":1},{"step":132,"speaker":"000","content":"我呀，做不了你的队友，做对手也能玩得开心，游戏嘛，好好享受最重要。","voice":["vo_event_402602021_127"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26202","style":1,"background":2259,"log_type":1},{"step":133,"speaker":"000","content":"等一切尘埃落定，你也会得到解放的。","voice":["vo_event_402602021_128"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26202","style":1,"background":2259,"log_type":1},{"step":134,"speaker":"选项","options":["什么解放"],"jump":[135],"style":6,"background":2259,"log_type":1},{"step":135,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"我就是自由的，没有人能控制我，我也不需要你解放。","style":2,"background":2259,"log_type":1},{"step":136,"speaker":"000","content":"好好好，时间差不多了，我先走咯。","voice":["vo_event_402602021_129"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26202","style":1,"background":2259,"log_type":1},{"step":137,"speaker":"000","content":"虽然很舍不得跟你一起的时光，可下一位神已经洗干净脖子等着我，不能再耽搁了。","voice":["vo_event_402602021_130"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26202","style":1,"background":2259,"log_type":1},{"step":138,"speaker":"000","content":"游戏开始了，要加入我也好，阻止我也好，放飞自我来这个异世界旅游也可以，就由你决定吧。","voice":["vo_event_402602021_131"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26202","style":1,"background":2259,"log_type":1},{"step":139,"speaker":"000","content":"既然你这么相信自己的意志。","voice":["vo_event_402602021_132"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26202","style":1,"background":2259,"log_type":1},{"step":141,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"局长，要追吗？","voice":["vo_event_402602021_92"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26202","style":11,"background":2277,"log_type":1},{"step":142,"speaker":"选项","options":["……你相信她那些荒谬的话吗？"],"jump":[143],"style":6,"background":2277,"log_type":1},{"step":143,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"嗯……好像没什么问题？","voice":["vo_event_402602021_93"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26202","style":11,"background":2277,"log_type":1},{"step":144,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"“世界是个巨大的游戏，而神制定一切规则”。呵呵，老电影里也有提过类似的设想，作为程序员，我还挺喜欢这种理解世界的角度。","voice":["vo_event_402602021_94"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26202","style":11,"background":2277,"log_type":1},{"step":145,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"除了神的造型……那真的太可爱了些，跟我想象的完全不一样呢。","voice":["vo_event_402602021_95"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26202","style":11,"background":2277,"log_type":1},{"step":146,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"那么，局长，你相信她说的吗？","voice":["vo_event_402602021_99"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26202","style":11,"background":2277,"log_type":1},{"step":147,"content":"不管她说的有多离谱，两个世界之间确实很可能存在某种强烈联系。","style":3,"background":2277,"log_type":1},{"step":148,"content":"你已经慢慢理解这张白板上所写的东西，与你的世界存在着许多相似之处，如果她真的可以夺取所有神的权限……","style":3,"background":2277,"log_type":1},{"step":149,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"必须阻止她，但……","style":2,"background":2277,"log_type":1},{"step":150,"content":"靠你被困在终端里的纸片儿身体……能做些什么……下一个目标……","style":3,"background":2277,"log_type":1},{"step":151,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"放心吧，我已经找到最可能被她盯上的目标了。","voice":["vo_event_402602021_100"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26202","style":11,"background":2277,"log_type":1},{"step":152,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"借用她的世界游戏论，狄斯城所在的世界暂且编号为5732号，这里则是开发者世界。","voice":["vo_event_402602021_101"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26202","style":11,"background":2277,"log_type":1},{"step":153,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"在两位被谋杀的鸭子的电脑上，我找到了一个类似开发者讨论群的网络空间，有不少ID在进行实时讨论，的确都是些跟我们世界有关的内容。","voice":["vo_event_402602021_133"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26202","style":11,"background":2277,"log_type":1},{"step":154,"content":"说着，她为你展示了一些聊天的片段。","style":3,"background":2277,"log_type":1},{"step":156,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"而有趣的是，就在那个禁闭者刚刚要离开时，开发者空间发起了新讨论：","voice":["vo_event_402602021_103"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26202","style":11,"background":2277,"log_type":1},{"step":158,"speaker":"选项","options":["下一个目标难道就是这个“代码嘎”？"],"jump":[159],"style":6,"background":2277,"log_type":1},{"step":159,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"很有可能。如果我是她，我也会先对这位鸭子动手。","voice":["vo_event_402602021_105"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26202","style":11,"background":2277,"log_type":1},{"step":160,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"毕竟“程序”权限可是非常重要的。","voice":["vo_event_402602021_106"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26202","style":11,"background":2277,"log_type":1},{"step":161,"content":"你捏了把汗。","style":3,"background":2277,"log_type":1},{"step":162,"speaker":"选项","options":["能追上她吗？"],"jump":[163],"style":6,"background":2277,"log_type":1},{"step":163,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"起码不能让她再得到更多力量了。","style":2,"background":2277,"log_type":1},{"step":164,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"瑞思已经定位到她前往的位置，这就为你查找可转移的目标终端。","voice":["vo_event_402602021_110"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_26202","style":11,"background":2277,"log_type":1},{"step":165,"content":"位置寻定中，你必须找到000，阻止她的计划。","style":3,"background":2277,"log_type":1},{"step":166,"content":"——至少，赶在她再次得手之前。","style":3,"background":2277,"log_type":1}]}